in  a place called the soul world a pocket  dimension located inside the soul stone  that's why thanos saw a young version of  gamora in the soul world when he snapped  since she was the one who he sacrificed  on vormir to get the soul stone the idea  was that when anyone used the stones  their consciousness would be transferred  to the soul world to atone for their  actions just as thanos's consciousness  was transferred to the soul world where  he explained that it cost everything to  achieve his goal with this deleted scene  though this whole concept has changed in  the scene tony sees his daughter morgan  who had basically nothing to do with  thanos or any sacrifice on vormir if  this scene were to be included it might  have made more sense for tony to see  natasha romanov who sacrificed herself  on vormir so that clint barton could  live and bring the soul stone back they  could have talked about how they both  sacrificed everything for the ones they  love even though they were leaving  behind different things this could have  been a pretty touching scene which  likely would have made more sense to  audiences if a short explanation was  given as to why thanos sagamora or why  tony saw natasha in this surreal world  it could be plausible that rather than a  pocket dimension located inside the soul  stone though the soul world is simply a  manifestation of the individual's fears  or regrets that they have to face after  using the stones that would basically be  the only case where it would make sense  for tony to see morgan in the soul world  rather than natasha all the details  aside if this scene had been included it  would have just further emphasized the  huge sacrifice tony made in order to  save the world many people complained  that tony could have simply given the  stones to captain marvel or the hulk to  take out thanos forces but as doctor  strange said after looking at 14 605  potential outcomes it was the only way  if he had tried to give them to someone  else thanosaurus forces could have  stopped him somehow tony was destined to  make this sacrifice from the moment he  said i am iron man in the first iron man  film this deleted scene would have just  punched that idea home further showing  the full emotional weight tony must have  felt and leaving behind not just his  wife but his daughter too ultimately  though the scene wasn't included in the  final cut of the film because it didn't  resonate with audiences and test  screenings the producers opted to skip  over the scene since it confused some  audiences and it seemed to slow down the  emotional development between scenes at  this point in the movie which makes  sense because the next scene would have  been tony's death scene one which is  pretty heavy emotionally following that  we get a hologram of tony giving his  final will and testament tony's funeral  and steve rogers handing off the mantle  of captain america to sam wilson all of  which are hefty emotional scenes it  makes sense that the scene wouldn't be  included due to the high number of  emotional scenes near the end of the  film also the scene would have caused  tons of confusion since the actress  playing tony's daughter morgan is one we  had yet to see before not only would  audiences be confused that there was a  new actress on screen but it would have  been confusing why tony was seeing his  daughter at all if the deleted scene had  been included though then people would  have likely had much different theories  about the infinity stones and in  particular about the soul stone if you  want to hear about the craziest marvel  theory we've seen check out this video  also don't forget to subscribe and like  this video and from everyone here at  stream in the galaxy thanks for watching  you
 

